Keep a shared prefix as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 15.
Place 0 into prefix.

Keep a shared best as 0.
Set best to -1000000.
The chart is a list of 1, 0, 1, 0, -1, 0, 1, 0, and 1.
For every spot from 0 to 8.
The row is spot divided by 3.
The column is spot modulo 3.
The target is (row plus 1) times 4 plus column plus 1.
The above is target minus 4.
The aside is target minus 1.
The corner is target minus 5.
Set item target of prefix to item spot of chart plus item above of prefix plus item aside of prefix minus item corner of prefix.

To sweep from left (a whole number) at top (a whole number) with bottom (a whole number).
If left is at least 3, return.
Sweep from left plus 1 at top with bottom.
For every right from left to 2.
The zone is (bottom plus 1) times 4 plus right plus 1.
The upper is top times 4 plus right plus 1.
The leftwan is top times 4 plus left.
The leftsouth is (bottom plus 1) times 4 plus left.
The total is item zone of prefix minus item upper of prefix minus item leftsouth of prefix plus item leftwan of prefix.
If total is at most 2 and total is more than best, set best to total.

To bands from top (a whole number) with bottom (a whole number).
If top is at least 3, return.
If bottom is at least 3, Bands from top plus 1 with top plus 1, return.
Sweep from 0 at top with bottom.
Bands from top with bottom plus 1.

Bands from 0 with 0.
Show best.
